Zstandard
---------

Vorticity.Zstd is an independent implementation of the Zstandard format (RFC 8878). Its decoding
algorithms and its validation follow those of the reference implementation, libzstd
(https://github.com/facebook/zstd), so that both accept and refuse the same frames. Its compressor
reproduces libzstd's compression parameters, match finders, block splitting and entropy coding,
so that both write the same frames; that part is derived from libzstd 1.5.7 and remains under its
license, quoted below.

